{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23702","headline":"花前有感兼呈崔相公刘郎中 · 白居易","name":"花前有感兼呈崔相公刘郎中","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"落花如雪鬓如霜，醉把花看益自伤。\n少日爲名多检束，长年无兴可颠狂。\n四时轮转春常少，百刻支分夜苦长。\n何事同生壬子岁，老於崔相及刘郎。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_23702.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23702","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}